{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01BBvrPBqYmbe6cGncaKrCQL", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://book.douban.com/subject/1443869/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://researchonline.lse.ac.uk/id/eprint/117976\"}, {\"url\": \"https://muse.jhu.edu/book/83346\"}, {\"url\": \"https://researchportal.hkust.edu.hk/en/publications/heidegger-formal-indication-and-sexual-difference/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://philarchive.org/rec/NELHFI\"}, {\"url\": \"https://api.philpapers.org/rec/NELHFI\"}, {\"url\": \"https://universityprofessorspress.com/new-release-eros-psyche-existential-perspectives-on-sexuality/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.abebooks.com/9780073532165/Human-Sexuality-Society-Culture-Polen-Petit-0073532169/plp\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.beyng.com/papers/HC2018Drouillard.html\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:50:25.885Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "人类的性存在 海德 德拉马特", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01HMavUzCghKQGqjreEgzApZ", "content": [{"title": "book.douban.com", "url": "https://book.douban.com/subject/1443869/"}, {"title": "Existence in its sexual being", "url": "https://researchonline.lse.ac.uk/id/eprint/117976"}, {"title": "In this Book", "url": "https://muse.jhu.edu/book/83346"}, {"title": "heidegger formal indication and sexual difference", "url": "https://researchportal.hkust.edu.hk/en/publications/heidegger-formal-indication-and-sexual-difference/"}, {"title": "Heidegger, Formal Indication, and Sexual Difference", "url": "https://philarchive.org/rec/NELHFI"}, {"title": "api.philpapers.org", "url": "https://api.philpapers.org/rec/NELHFI"}, {"title": "NEW RELEASE – Eros & Psyche: Existential Perspectives on Sexuality", "url": "https://universityprofessorspress.com/new-release-eros-psyche-existential-perspectives-on-sexuality/"}, {"title": "Items related to Human Sexuality: Self, Society, and Culture", "url": "https://www.abebooks.com/9780073532165/Human-Sexuality-Society-Culture-Polen-Petit-0073532169/plp"}, {"title": "Heidegger’s Sexless Community: ni homme, ni femme — c’est un Dasein", "url": "https://www.beyng.com/papers/HC2018Drouillard.html"}]}, "搜索结果主要指向两个方向。\n\n**1. 教材《人类的性存在》**：这是珍妮特·S·海德（Janet S. Hyde）与约翰·D·德拉马特（John D. DeLamater）合著的性学教材，原书名为 *Understanding Human Sexuality*。中译本由上海社会科学院出版社于2005年出版，第8版共679页。该书译者为贺岭峰、李强、高旭辰。一位豆瓣读者评价它从生理学、社会学、心理学和统计学等交叉视角来考察人类的性存在，适合当作性学入门参考。\n\n**2. 哲学语境中的“性存在”**：如果你指的是海德格尔的思想，学界有一篇讨论“存在于其性存在中”（existence in its sexual being）的论文，它结合德里达对海德格尔“此在”（Dasein）一词的解读，探讨其中尚未完全二元化的性别差异概念。另一篇发表于 *Eksistenz*（2022）的文章由 Eric S. Nelson 撰写，认为人类性别差异并非只是生物或人类学意义上的既定事实，而是在与他人、环境和自我的关系中被展开和实现的。\n\n如果你需要的是其中某一方面的具体内容（教材章节，或海德格尔与德里达的性别论述），可以告诉我，我再进一步搜索。"], "durationSeconds": 6.851068583, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01BBvrPBqYmbe6cGncaKrCQL", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
